JEI for Horizon
===============

This mod is a port of JustEnoughItems (JEI), a Minecraft item and recipe viewer,
to Horizon. JEI is:

  Copyright (c) 2014-2015 mezz
  Licensed under the MIT License.
  https://github.com/mezz/JustEnoughItems

Parts of this mod's behaviour, tests, UI strings and (from Phase 3 on) a few
GUI sprites are derived from JEI's source, which is MIT-licensed; the original
copyright notice above applies to those parts.

GUI sprites
-----------

content/jei/assets/jei/textures/gui/sprites/ holds the GUI sprites of
JustEnoughItems for Minecraft 1.12 (the `1.12` branch at commit
4f70a47889e97f72d2c344fead75e1065c60e13a, src/main/resources/assets/jei/
textures/gui/sprites/), unchanged, under JEI's MIT License (copied beside them
as license-jei.txt). JEI's gui_vanilla.png is not included: it is cut from
Minecraft's own textures.

This is an unofficial port. It is not made, endorsed or supported by mezz, the
JEI team, Mojang, Microsoft, or the Horizon project.

Horizon is a Rust reimplementation of Minecraft: Java Edition. Minecraft is a
trademark of Mojang Synergies AB. This mod contains no Minecraft code or assets;
it reads the game's own files at run time.